<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia AMDB 6-month net down 28 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia AMDB 6-month net down 28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Sept 30</p>
<p>		(in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 14.50     vs	   20.14</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 2.5	vs	    3.5</p>
<p>    Turnover		  402.40     vs	  256.14</p>
<p>    Pretax profit	    33.51     vs	   28.81</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less   0.96     vs   less   1.39</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries  gain  41.21     vs   loss   0.86</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Arab-Malaysian Development Bhd. It is involved in property development, manufacturing, hotel operation and road construction.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
